OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Scattered showers across the
OL,7,Fnorth will move southwards through the
OL,8,Fday, though many areas will remain
OL,9,Fdry. A few of the showers could be on
OL,10,Fthe heavy side. Less hot than Thursday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally dry, with clear
OL,13,Fspells. A few light showers remain
OL,14,Fpossible, these mostly across the far
OL,15,Fnorth. Remaining warm in urban areas,
OL,16,Fwith a light northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
