OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright day for
OL,6,Fmany, with plenty of sunshine. Perhaps
OL,7,Fa few light showers developing in the
OL,8,Fnorth by late afternoon. A pleasant
OL,9,Ffeeling day, with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLargely
OL,12,Fdry with bright or sunny spells on
OL,13,FSunday and Monday, but also some
OL,14,Fcloud. Turning breezier mid-week with
OL,15,Fthe chance of rain. Temperatures near
OL,16,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
